{"title":"What should I ask Simon Sebag Montefiore?","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/972821378/0/marginalrevolution~What-should-I-ask-Simon-Sebag-Montefiore.html","date":1794405324000,"content":"<p>I will be doing a Conversation with him, most of all about his new and very good book <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/Cauldron-Making-Modern-Middle-East/dp/0593805054/ref=sr_1_1?crid=15K0SWKH4DCDD&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.nXTABoITW3biOlAy1WBbC-6LfoOuxZzeXHyKqurTvslbvwpOScQ0XCDuUfG4JXqdE8rM0wx3q6OiSmLu3RSnxZLT_HQEAqHtvZIUq262UuJ1CB5bwKfKxojZsvCzvoWd2-hONdraQAopBQqu-I7i-VKVXh7Un2muPMcGQtIICtpUSZjkB4yWuUHMTIVQm55rjCK80BidJ0Lx0WV6OR5WlIGJEMr1gSHNusCm3RKFT-c.BlKh-mMUUjDdkzXRh3mDRoAtBvT_oU9_4uAIdtPowAM&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=simon+sebag+montefiore+books&amp;qid=1794405150&amp;sprefix=simon+se%2Caps%2C159&amp;sr=8-1\" target=\"_blank\">The Cauldron: The Making of the Modern Middle East</a>.  He has <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/s?k=simon+sebag+montefiore+books&amp;crid=15K0SWKH4DCDD&amp;sprefix=simon+se%2Caps%2C159&amp;ref=nb_sb_ss_p13n-expert-pd-ops-ranker_1_8\" target=\"_blank\">many other excellent books too</a>, including on Russian history and some fiction.  Here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.weidenfeldandnicolson.co.uk/contributor/simon-sebag-montefiore/\" target=\"_blank\">his home page</a>, here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Simon_Sebag_Montefiore\" target=\"_blank\">his Wikipedia page</a>.</p>\r\n<p>So what should I ask him?</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/11/what-should-i-ask-simon-sebag-montefiore.html\">What should I ask Simon Sebag Montefiore?</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrev